---
---

<section id="feature-alternating-rows" class="section feature-alternating-rows">
  <!-- kit: feature-alternating-rows -->
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head section-head--center">
      <h2>Engineered at the foundry, proven at the fire.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="far-rows">
      <article class="far-row far-row--media-right">
        <div class="far-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">The pour</span>
          <h3>Thin walls that still hold heat like a brick.</h3>
          <div class="far-body">
            <p>We pour at 2,600°F into <strong>sand moulds we make by hand</strong>, then machine the cooking surface smooth. The result is a pan that heats evenly in four minutes and stays hot when the steak goes in.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="far-points">
            <li>3.8 lb for a 10" skillet</li>
            <li>Machined, glass-smooth surface</li>
            <li>Poured and finished in Bend, OR</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="far-link" href="/products/ridge-skillet" title='Ridge Skillet 10"'>See the Ridge Skillet <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <figure class="far-media">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-foundry-pour/1200/900" alt="Molten iron pouring into a sand mould at the Bend foundry" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" style="object-position: 52% 40%;" />
        </figure>
      </article>

      <article class="far-row far-row--media-left">
        <div class="far-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">The fold</span>
          <h3>A grill that folds to the size of a laptop.</h3>
          <div class="far-body">
            <p>The Cable Fold collapses along two stainless hinges and slides into its own canvas sleeve. Unfolded, it holds four steaks over a fire ring.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="far-points">
            <li>Folds to 14 × 10 × 1.5 in</li>
            <li>Stainless hinges rated for 10,000 cycles</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="far-link" href="/products/cable-fold" title="Cable Fold Grill">Shop the Cable Fold <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <figure class="far-media">
          <video src="https://cdn.caldera.co/film/cable-fold-unfold-loop.mp4" poster="https://picsum.photos/seed/cable-fold-loop/1200/900" width="1200" height="900" muted loop playsinline controls preload="none" aria-label="The Cable Fold grill unfolding"></video>
        </figure>
      </article>

      <article class="far-row far-row--media-right">
        <div class="far-copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">The seasoning</span>
          <h3>Non-stick from the first egg.</h3>
          <div class="far-body">
            <p>Three coats of flaxseed and grapeseed oil, each baked at 500°F. No PFAS, no coatings, nothing to flake off.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="far-media">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/caldera-seasoning-egg/1200/900" alt="A fried egg sliding off a freshly seasoned skillet" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" />
        </figure>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .far-rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }
  .far-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .far-row--media-left .far-media {
    order: -1;
  }
  .far-copy h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
  }
  .far-body {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .far-points {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .far-points li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
  }
  .far-points li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.45em;
    width: 1rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--brand);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand);
    transform: rotate(-45deg);
  }
  .far-link {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--brand);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .far-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .far-media {
    margin: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .far-media img,
  .far-media video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .far-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .far-row .far-media {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
